        -:  680:// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
        -:  681:// wxThreadHelper: this class implements the threading logic to run a
        -:  682:// background task in another object (such as a window).  It is a mix-in: just
        -:  683:// derive from it to implement a threading background task in your class.
        -:  684:// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
        -:  685:
        -:  686:class wxThreadHelper
        -:  687:{
        -:  688:private:
